                            <comment id="16092152" author="herval" created="Tue, 18 Jul 2017 20:38:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also curious on why the implementation tries to fetch &lt;b&gt;all groups&lt;/b&gt; and then checks if the user is in all of them, versus fetching the user object and fetching the groups they&apos;re &quot;memberOf&quot;. This info exists in the LDAP we use here - is this non-standard/discouraged for any reason?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16094991" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 20 Jul 2017 17:11:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user herval opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2498&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2498&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2796&quot; title=&quot;LDAP fetching of roles not working?&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2796&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2796&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Fetching LDAP roles&lt;/p&gt;

